  "id": "spicy-tomato-and-lentil-soup",
  "name": "Spicy Tomato and Lentil Soup",
  "subtitle": "A quick, warming soup with tender red lentils",
  "description": "Red lentils simmer with tomatoes, onion, chile, and herbs, then receive a cool sour-cream topping and fresh basil garnish.",
